WEBVTT

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:04.760
The Nahel Argama, which has been
standing by in Earth's orbit,

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.720
joins the Garencieres.

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:10.300
Banagher and Mineva are reunited
with Takuya and the others.

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:13.300
You know the coordinates
to Laplace's Box already, right?

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:18.510
You can't keep them
hidden forever.

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:20.630
To break the stalemate,

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:26.300
Captain Otto of the Nahel Argama
forms a joint front with Neo Zeon.

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:29.840
I'll be damned if I let you people
get your hands on Laplace's Box

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:33.220
and have the Earth Sphere
be thrown into chaos again.

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:38.010
Mineva asks Full Frontal
to reveal his true intentions,

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:40.470
and he explains his plan
for a Side Co-Prosperity Sphere,

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:42.880
in which the Sides will
strengthen their economic ties

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:45.760
and exclude the Earth from them.

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:48.720
You talk like it doesn't affect you.

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:51.630
Even though you're talking about
your own people's future,

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:55.630
what you're saying sounds cold and
detached, like it doesn't involve you.

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:59.840
Industrial 7.
Its colony builder, Magallanica.

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:04.930
That is the final set of coordinates
given by the La+ program.

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:09.720
Meanwhile Riddhe, who has been
deeply wounded by Mineva's rejection,

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:15.260
receives the Banshee Norn from Alberto Vist
and pursues the Unicorn Gundam.

00:02:47.090 --> 00:02:51.300
(NAHEL ARGAMA RECAPTURED)

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:05.380
Banagher, guest! Guest!

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:16.220
Ms. Marida! Are you sure
you should be out of- -

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:17.220
Here.

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:20.430
I can't handle the taste.
Help me with it.

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:25.260
It's supposed to be good
for invalids, but it's disgusting.

00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:29.260
Banagher, help out! Help out!
It's disgusting!

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:35.470
You weren't kidding, it's terrible!

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:36.510
Right?

00:03:37.010 --> 00:03:40.590
Ms. Marida, what sort
of foods do you like?

00:03:40.630 --> 00:03:42.220
Why do you ask?

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:44.720
I'd rather know what you like
than what you hate.

00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:47.970
I've never thought about it.

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:51.430
What do you think tastes really good?
Come on, there has to be something.

00:03:52.220 --> 00:03:53.800
Like sweet things or whatever.

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:55.340
Dessert! Dessert!

00:03:57.510 --> 00:03:59.470
Ice cream, I suppose.

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:03.010
I know just the place! There's a great
ice cream parlor on Industrial 7!

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:04.090
I can take you...

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:12.590
What the Captain says
is right, isn't it?

00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:17.880
I think so. But...

00:04:18.760 --> 00:04:20.760
It's always like that.

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:23.050
Every time I think,

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:26.590
"But... Even so,"
everything blows up in my face.

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:28.880
No matter how hard
I fight, it always...

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:40.010
But thanks to that, I'm sitting here
talking to you like this.

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:42.470
The way you feel isn't wrong.

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:46.680
"Trust in the possibilities within,

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:50.970
and try with all your might to do
what you feel you ought to do."

00:04:51.010 --> 00:04:52.680
That isn't a curse.

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:56.840
The person who told you that
probably lived his life the same way.

00:04:56.880 --> 00:05:00.380
Never knowing for sure,
simply believing it was right.

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:02.840
But that's so irresponsible.

00:05:03.550 --> 00:05:05.550
Not seeing it through on his own...

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:08.010
That might be true.

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:10.470
But still. Even so...

00:05:10.510 --> 00:05:12.970
He was lucky to be able
to entrust his dream

00:05:13.010 --> 00:05:15.340
to someone who wasn't a stranger.

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:19.680
This must be how the world
moves forward a little bit at a time.

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:23.130
If you hold on tight to your dreams,
if you never give up,

00:05:23.180 --> 00:05:24.760
if you never become closed-minded...

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:28.840
I know your chance will come.

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:31.680
When it does, don't hesitate.

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:33.300
Get into the Gundam.

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:40.840
- Princess.
- Are you feeling better?

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:41.970
Yes.

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:46.880
Forgive me, Marida. I...

00:05:46.930 --> 00:05:50.220
I hope that you follow
your heart, too, Princess.

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:02.470
I told Mr. Conroy what we're up to.
He said to be careful.

00:06:02.510 --> 00:06:05.340
Since we don't have the whole ship
behind us, we have to do it this way.

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:09.010
Okay, if we use this as our opening,
we can drive them off the ship.

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:15.470
Still, do you really think that girl
is planning to do something, Micott?

00:06:16.090 --> 00:06:19.430
She told Full Frontal
the Box's coordinates.

00:06:19.470 --> 00:06:20.680
That was to throw him off his guard.

00:06:21.220 --> 00:06:22.130
I don't think- -

00:06:22.180 --> 00:06:26.340
When women lie, my skin tingles.
That girl is serious.

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:31.550
I don't get women at all...

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:35.800
What are you up to in here?

00:06:45.430 --> 00:06:47.880
It doesn't have legs...

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:51.930
If it weren't for the General Revil's
surprise attack,

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:54.630
you would have taken over
the Nahel Argama

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:57.800
even if we had not shown up,
wouldn't you, Captain?

00:06:58.470 --> 00:07:00.800
You brought me here
to ask me that, sir?

00:07:01.800 --> 00:07:03.800
Does it seem meaningless?

00:07:04.510 --> 00:07:09.340
The hatred you've clung to all these
years, never being able to be rid of it,

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:11.800
and now you've dreamt of
other possibilities?

00:07:11.840 --> 00:07:16.430
Was it the boy who did this to you?
Or Lt. Marida?

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:20.050
I admit, this isn't a hatred I could
let go of even if I wanted to.

00:07:20.090 --> 00:07:22.930
But "meaningless" isn't quite
the right word.

00:07:22.970 --> 00:07:24.720
I suppose I'm tired.

00:07:24.760 --> 00:07:27.590
Tired of the me that's
given up on everything

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:30.130
and is huddled in the darkness.

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:33.590
Maybe Char...

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:37.720
Maybe Char Aznable was in the
same state of mind I am right now

00:07:37.760 --> 00:07:43.510
when he chose creating the world of
Newtypes that his father dreamed of

00:07:43.550 --> 00:07:48.430
over revenge against the Zabi family.

00:07:48.970 --> 00:07:53.430
If Char Aznable
were still alive right now,

00:07:53.470 --> 00:07:57.380
perhaps he'd no longer
be entirely human.

00:08:04.090 --> 00:08:05.430
What is it?

00:08:05.470 --> 00:08:08.510
Captain, there's a ship
heading this way.

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:10.760
It appears to be
a Federation patrol vessel.

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:14.510
This is the patrol vessel
El Faro, with the L1 Patrol.

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:18.180
Londo Bell vessel Nahel Argama,
we have received your distress signal.

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:19.430
Please respond.

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:23.880
What are they talking about?
Who sent out a distress signal?

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:26.380
That one ship could...

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:28.510
Ensign Mihiro!

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:29.630
Sir!

00:08:29.680 --> 00:08:31.050
Get rid of them right away.

00:08:31.090 --> 00:08:34.800
If we let them hang around,
those Neo Zeons won't sit idly by.

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:36.220
Understood.

00:08:36.470 --> 00:08:41.010
Wait a minute. Londo Bell vessel
Nahel Argama, respond at once.

00:08:41.050 --> 00:08:44.010
We're detecting Neo Zeon
vessels around you.

00:08:44.050 --> 00:08:47.130
Two Musaka Class,
one Rewloola Class.

00:08:47.180 --> 00:08:50.010
Both are transmitting
Federation Forces IFF codes.

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:52.180
Requesting explanation!

00:08:52.220 --> 00:08:55.630
Depending on situation,
we will go to combat alert!

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:57.510
Respond!

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:01.510
Londo Bell vessel Nahel Argama...

00:09:01.550 --> 00:09:02.630
Captain!

00:09:03.630 --> 00:09:06.010
Destroy them, Captain.

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:09.050
...state your mission
and your destination!

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:11.220
Give the order to attack right away.

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:14.260
Don't be ridiculous!
That ship is one of ours!

00:09:14.300 --> 00:09:18.260
They'll call for reinforcements if
you don't. We might be destroyed!

00:09:20.090 --> 00:09:22.010
This is your responsibility.

00:09:22.050 --> 00:09:26.180
Londo Bell vessel Nahel Argama,
state your mission and your destination!

00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:33.260
Some misguided souls aboard your ship
have put our joint front at risk.

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:35.010
They're the ones who sent out
the distress signal?

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:37.880
We can fire on them from our own ships.

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:41.720
But this is your mess, so you
should be the ones to clean it up.

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:46.130
If you refuse, we'll take it to mean
that our joint front has been dissolved.

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:48.840
I say again! Londo Bell vessel
Nahel Argama...

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:51.090
Your decision, Capt. Otto!

00:09:51.340 --> 00:09:54.840
...we will deal with you
according to garrison regulations.

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:56.220
They can't do this!

00:10:11.930 --> 00:10:15.470
Decide quickly!
You have civilians on board.

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:28.180
I dare you to lay one finger on them!
I'll rip your head off, boy!

00:10:30.220 --> 00:10:33.840
You people are no soldiers!
You're nothing but terrorists!

00:10:33.880 --> 00:10:35.760
And I do not negotiate with terrorists!

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:41.220
Our alliance with you people is over!

00:10:41.760 --> 00:10:43.300
That's telling him, Captain.

00:11:07.300 --> 00:11:08.840
You bastards!

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:24.010
Explain everything to the patrol ship!
Have them get clear!

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:24.970
Yes, sir!

00:11:25.760 --> 00:11:27.930
How dare they do this
while the Captain is away!

00:11:30.680 --> 00:11:32.260
What do we do?

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:33.720
How should I...

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:38.180
The mobile suit deck!
Secure the Garencieres Team's suits!

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:44.220
That you, Banagher? Get down
to the mobile suit deck!

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:50.050
Get into the Gundam and smash all
the Neo Zeon mobile suits' cockpits.

00:11:50.090 --> 00:11:51.840
It'll keep unnecessary combat
to a minimum.

00:11:51.880 --> 00:11:53.090
Right!

00:11:53.260 --> 00:11:54.720
Banagher!

00:11:55.220 --> 00:11:56.760
Don't get carried away.

00:11:56.800 --> 00:11:59.930
Don't throw away the life
that Commander Daguza saved.

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:03.220
Right!

00:12:07.590 --> 00:12:12.130
Get into the Gundam and smash all
the Neo Zeon mobile suits' cockpits.

00:12:12.170 --> 00:12:13.920
It'll keep unnecessary combat
to a minimum.

00:12:13.970 --> 00:12:15.260
Right!

00:12:15.340 --> 00:12:16.510
Banagher!

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:18.880
Don't get carried away.

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:22.050
Don't throw away the life
that Commander Daguza saved.

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:25.090
Right!

00:12:35.220 --> 00:12:37.130
Don't let those Neo Zeon
bastards off the ship!

00:12:37.170 --> 00:12:39.090
We can use them as hostages
against the Rewloola.

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:41.300
Engine block secured!

00:12:41.340 --> 00:12:42.880
Two hostiles have escaped
towards the bow of the ship!

00:12:43.340 --> 00:12:45.970
Tighten security on
the mobile suit deck!

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:48.420
Mobile suit deck here!
Still engaging enemy forces!

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:49.800
Requesting reinforcements!

00:12:49.840 --> 00:12:52.970
Hangar Control secured!
Beginning repairs!

00:12:53.010 --> 00:12:56.130
Don't let the enemy pilots
reach their mobile suits!

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:08.420
That's enough of that, Banagher.

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:10.630
I suggest you don't try
anything foolish.

00:13:10.670 --> 00:13:17.010
Now that we know where the Box is,
we can kill you without hesitation.

00:13:17.050 --> 00:13:18.920
Destroy the Unicorn, as well.

00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:22.550
Why do you refuse?

00:13:22.590 --> 00:13:24.630
If the Box is handed over
to the Federation,

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:28.380
it will just mean the continuation
of the same old twisted world.

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:32.550
Isn't that against the wishes
of your father,

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:34.470
who had hoped for a reformation?

00:13:35.380 --> 00:13:38.840
Only we can use the Box
to grant the cherished dream

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:42.050
of the abandoned Spacenoid people.

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:44.220
What can you do?

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:48.090
How would you use Laplace's Box?

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:51.470
For everyone.

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:53.590
I'd use it for everyone.

00:13:53.630 --> 00:13:57.510
Not for the Federation, for Zeon,
for space, or for Earth.

00:13:57.550 --> 00:13:59.880
I'd use Laplace's Box for everyone!

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:07.300
Captain!

00:14:11.550 --> 00:14:14.340
And who, exactly, is this
"everyone" you speak of?

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:19.510
One man cannot be the voice
for the wishes of all humanity.

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:22.510
Not unless he becomes a vessel.

00:14:22.550 --> 00:14:26.090
But the only ones who can become vessels
are those who have emptied themselves

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:29.760
and passed through madness
to emerge on the other side.

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:32.670
That is no simple matter.

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:35.880
Still, you have talent.

00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:40.130
If you would truly become
a vessel, come with me.

00:14:41.170 --> 00:14:44.170
You, who have been entrusted with
your father's dreams and been

00:14:44.220 --> 00:14:47.170
forced to undergo training,
are a Cyber-Newtype of sorts.

00:14:47.220 --> 00:14:49.550
Now that you have exhibited
the power of one,

00:14:49.590 --> 00:14:52.510
you can never go back
to being part of that "everyone".

00:14:52.550 --> 00:14:57.130
One day, you will run headlong
into the same despair that I did.

00:14:57.170 --> 00:15:00.470
Keep saying, "Even so," Banagher!

00:15:04.510 --> 00:15:05.720
Just die, already!

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:12.050
Withdraw your forces, Full Frontal.

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:14.760
We won't walk down
the same path as you!

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:16.510
Audrey...

00:15:16.550 --> 00:15:18.260
The Second Coming of the Red Comet...

00:15:18.670 --> 00:15:21.970
There was a time when
we clung to your strength.

00:15:22.010 --> 00:15:26.130
When we were being hounded by
the Federation, we had nothing else.

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:28.670
But you are not Char!

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:32.800
The Char that I knew
believed in human possibility!

00:15:33.170 --> 00:15:35.970
Why do you refuse to understand
the Captain's ideas?!

00:15:42.590 --> 00:15:46.630
Garencieres Team! Officers and soldiers
of Neo Zeon! Hear me!

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:49.760
Whatever Laplace's Box turns out to be,

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:52.760
it will mark a profound
turning point for us.

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:57.010
It may even be capable of bringing about
the future that Frontal speaks of.

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:59.170
He may very well prove correct.

00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:01.470
It may be the only realistic answer

00:16:01.510 --> 00:16:04.760
to ensure humanity's
continued existence.

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:08.720
However, can that truly
be called the future?

00:16:09.340 --> 00:16:12.300
Wasn't "the future" supposed
to refer to a time

00:16:12.340 --> 00:16:15.220
that is different from the present?!
A better world?!

00:16:15.800 --> 00:16:17.880
The human evolution and harmony
that were dreamed of

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:20.300
by Zeon Deikun are
nowhere in that world.

00:16:20.340 --> 00:16:22.380
As the successors
to the name of Zeon,

00:16:22.420 --> 00:16:25.470
as those who brought about
the tragedies of the One Year War,

00:16:25.510 --> 00:16:28.340
we have a responsibility!

00:16:29.260 --> 00:16:32.380
If we simply accept reality
as reality,

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:34.760
we cannot fulfill that responsibility.

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:36.550
The light that the Unicorn showed us- -

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:38.300
Marida Cruz.

00:16:39.090 --> 00:16:41.470
Open your cockpit.

00:16:41.510 --> 00:16:42.590
Marida!

00:16:45.470 --> 00:16:48.050
How can the last child of
the Zabi family say such a thing?!

00:16:56.800 --> 00:16:58.170
Audrey!

00:16:59.470 --> 00:17:03.260
That's enough. Come out of your cockpit
and bring the Princess with you.

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:07.300
Marida! Snap out of it, Marida!

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:14.130
Zinnerman! Are you still
a prisoner of the past?!

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:16.420
Even though you have Marida?!

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:18.720
Carry out your own responsibilities!

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:23.010
Zinnerman! Ever since the day you
rescued Marida, I thought you had- -

00:17:23.260 --> 00:17:25.510
Reason can't make them go away.

00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:31.760
The hatred...

00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:33.670
The regret...

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:38.920
I couldn't do anything for them...

00:17:40.590 --> 00:17:43.800
Even though they must have
been so scared... In such pain...

00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:45.380
Nothing at all...

00:17:46.260 --> 00:17:47.880
Fi... Marie...

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:54.170
F-Father.

00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:01.670
Will you let me have my way
this one time?

00:18:14.840 --> 00:18:15.840
All right.

00:18:22.420 --> 00:18:27.760
This is my final order to you.
Listen to your heart.

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:29.760
Understood.

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:37.590
Zinnerman, you bastard!

00:18:45.170 --> 00:18:50.380
You people are always like this!

00:18:50.420 --> 00:18:52.840
Irresponsible! Weak!

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:55.220
That's why...

00:18:58.170 --> 00:19:00.550
That's why we need power
that goes beyond humanity!

00:19:00.590 --> 00:19:03.170
The Captain is a man
who's transcended humanity!

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:04.800
Humanity's future...

00:19:05.510 --> 00:19:07.670
is to be built by humans, isn't it?

00:19:12.260 --> 00:19:17.010
People are weak. Flawed.
That's why we entrust it to each other.

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:20.670
It's passed on, and people
keep walking forward.

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:23.880
No matter how painful
the path might be!

00:19:28.630 --> 00:19:30.670
What? What's this light?

00:19:31.340 --> 00:19:32.670
Angelo.

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:35.470
Captain!

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:48.170
Angelo!

00:19:48.220 --> 00:19:49.260
Banagher.

00:19:50.090 --> 00:19:52.800
We'll be taking our leave now.

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:55.840
Wait!

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:58.760
From here on out, it's a race.

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:47.840
We can't cordon off
the entire Shoal Zone- -

00:20:48.420 --> 00:20:50.090
Sorry for interrupting your meeting.

00:20:51.470 --> 00:20:56.050
I have the perfect solution
for this situation, Chairman Ronan.

00:20:58.590 --> 00:21:00.510
Maximum combat speed!

00:21:00.550 --> 00:21:03.800
All crew members engaged in firefighting
operations, brace for acceleration!

00:21:12.720 --> 00:21:14.720
That's the Full Armor, huh?

00:21:16.050 --> 00:21:18.720
So, what do we do now?

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:24.170
If I asked you to put me out
of my misery, would you do it?

00:21:24.670 --> 00:21:26.720
That's not even funny, sir.

00:21:26.760 --> 00:21:29.470
There's still a lot
that needs to be done.

00:21:29.510 --> 00:21:31.510
By me. And by you, Captain.

00:21:36.510 --> 00:21:38.090
I suppose.

00:23:38.220 --> 00:23:41.470
Next time, on Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn

00:23:41.510 --> 00:23:43.800
FATEFUL BATTLE

00:23:45.050 --> 00:23:48.380
awaken the Newtype that lies within you.
